ondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20121129191608&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Leech_510432.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a leech.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 2.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">A hermit near Carlin might be able to tell you more about it.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Use it on a <a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20Buffalo\">Water Buffalo</a> to tame it.\n</p><p>When you use it, you may get the following messages:\n</p>\n<ul><li><i>The water buffalo ignores you.</i>  — nothing has happened and you may try again</li>\n<li><i>The water buffalo flees.</i> —  the buffalo disappeared and you will have to find another one</li>\n<li><i>The leech slipped through your fingers and is now following the call of nature.</i> — the leech disappeared</li>\n<li><i>The leech appeased the water buffalo and your taming was successful.</i>  — you tamed the buffalo</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\nIt can be obtained through swamp digging. Players also reported to have obtained the Leech by doing the new daily tasks. It may be a possible reward of the <a href=\"#/quest/venore-daily-tasks-quest\">Venore Daily Tasks Quest</a> or the <a href=\"#/quest/goblin-merchant-quest\">Goblin Merchant Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Flooring</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/goblin-merchant-quest\">Goblin Merchant Quest</a></li><li>Swamp (Diggable)</li><li>Swamp Beast</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Taming%20Items\">Taming Items</a></li><li>Tiles</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/venore-daily-tasks-quest\">Venore Daily Tasks Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20Buffalo\">Water Buffalo</a></li><li>Water Buffalo (Mount)</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["goblin-merchant-quest","venore-daily-tasks-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"venore-daily-tasks-quest","quest":"Venore Daily Tasks Quest","step":"1-1","n":4,"title":"Obra norte","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33022,"y":32013,"z":7,"label":"Obra norte"},{"x":33042,"y":32021,"z":7,"label":"Quadrado de pântano para cavar a Leech (opcional)"},{"x":33017,"y":32041,"z":6,"label":"Máquina"},{"x":33016,"y":32026,"z":6,"label":"Máquina"},{"x":33015,"y":32022,"z":6,"label":"Máquina"}]}]}}